    {
      "source": "Returns true whether the property indicates the documents language either by having a <a href=\"MongoPersistentProperty.html#getFieldName()\"><code>MongoPersistentProperty.getFieldName()</code></a> equal\nto language or being annotated with <a href=\"Language.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>Language</code></a>.",
